    "commit_body": "Portfolio-stage filter validated by N=1000 canonical 3-mode MC\n(experiments/esp_d5_validate_n1000.py): 5y compound +44.7% Realistic\nvs production baseline; all annual windows within +/-7%; all DD-C\nunder 80% (5y DD-C improved 77.1% -> 75.0%); 0% collapse.\n\nPer-trade A/B (experiments/earn_supp_put_pretest.py, 5y): 16-20 puts\nin earnings window regress -3.1pp WR15 at d=3 (N=735); shrinks to\n-0.4pp at d=5 (N=1186). 21-25 neutral; <=15 actually OUTPERFORM.\nMechanism: ~982 puts/year filtered, freeing slot capacity in the\nshared 14-pool. Per-trade signal small but slot-displacement\ncompounds across the cascade (same lesson as F3f knob 2026-04-24).\n\nWired into: monte_carlo.py, backtest_cascade.py, trader.py CLI\nbacktest + day-signals. api.py simulate_trader is calls-only.\n\nAlso documents two null results from the same investigation:\n- Put concentration (PT15/PT20/Design D) - all FAIL canonical gate;\n  same capital-velocity paradox as A050/rollups/v22-v23.\n- Earnings-window call PROMOTION - per-trade WR uplift +16pp on\n  75-79 PRE-ern; ALL meaningful boost variants FAIL by -25 to -38%\n  on 5y. Per-trade-WR != option-TP-rate due to IV crush.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
